{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10002","headline":"代征人妻喜夫还 · 梁鍠","name":"代征人妻喜夫还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征夫走马发渔阳，少妇含娇开洞房。\n千日废台还挂镜，数年尘面再新妆。\n春风喜出今朝户，明日虚眠昨夜牀。\n莫道幽闺书信隔，还衣总是旧时香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁鍠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}